note bottom of schedule_versions
  Publish locks the schedule and requires parent=current.
  Published versions and presented/rejected/failed proposals freeze.
  Source deletion may null real FKs while snapshots survive.
end note
note bottom of schedule_items
  TASK/EVENT/BREAK kinds use explicit FK columns.
  Weekly occurrences resolve both local endpoints separately.
  Half-open intervals cannot overlap within a version.
end note
note bottom of focus_sessions
  One existing shared table, now owned by Attention.
  Energy reexports the same mapped class.
end note
